{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/122398","id":4276740382,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc7-6eEe","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/122398","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/122398.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/122398.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/122398","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/122398/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/122398/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/122398/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/d38fb5940bad01dba71aa550b9c0521c7e0ba731","number":122398,"state":"open","locked":false,"title":"Make emit show signal args in intellisense","user":{"login":"Goldenlion5648","id":32916571,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMyOTE2NTcx","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/32916571?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Goldenlion5648","html_url":"https://github.com/Goldenlion5648","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Goldenlion5648/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Goldenlion5648/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Goldenlion5648/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Goldenlion5648/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Goldenlion5648/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Goldenlion5648/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Goldenlion5648/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Goldenlion5648/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Goldenlion5648/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"## What problem(s) does this PR solve?\r\n\r\n- Closes https://github.com/godotengine/godot-proposals/discussions/15375\r\n- Addresses https://github.com/godotengine/godot-proposals/issues/12779 (which for some reason was closed)\r\n\r\n## Additional information\r\nOnly one file is code changes (only 4 lines), the rest are test cases.\r\n\r\nReferencing @AThousandShips example from the second issue above, these all show intellisense\r\n```gdscript\r\nextends Node2D\r\nclass_name MyClass\r\n\r\nsignal my_signal(foo: String, bar: int)\r\n\r\nfunc foo():\r\n    # My comment, not in the original: all of these do show intellisense with this pr\r\n    my_signal.emit(3, 4)  # Would work here.\r\n    var me: MyClass = self\r\n    me.my_signal.emit()  # Would work here too.\r\n    var other_me = self\r\n    other_me.my_signal.emit()  # DOES work here.\r\n    var my_signal_var = my_signal\r\n    my_signal_var.emit()  # DOES work here.\r\n```\r\nAfter PR\r\n<img width=\"812\" height=\"325\" alt=\"image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/eeb9a72f-3cbd-4c0d-a68a-057cdf3304f8\" />\r\n\r\nBefore PR\r\n<img width=\"657\" height=\"108\" alt=\"image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/2d545baa-9b7c-4c24-8ef3-f94d7fc7475d\" />\r\n\r\nAlso works when the signal has no types (after PR):\r\n\r\n\r\n<img width=\"877\" height=\"91\" alt=\"image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/03e4e080-5503-458b-b31a-583dbdac4e12\" />\r\n\r\n\r\nA check could be added for similar situations like emit_signal\r\n","labels":[{"id":73330066,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2Ng==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/enhancement","name":"enhancement","description":"","color":"aaccff","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279098082,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTgwODI=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:gdscript","name":"topic:gdscript","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"arc